participant Analyst "Analyst" actor
participant Agent "AI Agent"
participant DNS "DoH / DNS Server"
participant Intel "Threat Intel API"
msg Analyst -> Agent solid filled #1 "Request Attribution (example.com)"
msg Agent -> DNS solid filled #2 "Query A/AAAA/MX Records"
msg DNS -> Agent dotted filled #3 "Return DNS Records & IPs"
msg Agent -> Intel solid filled #4 "Query Indicators & Pulses"
msg Intel -> Agent dotted filled #5 "Return Reputation & Threat Data"
msg Agent -> Analyst solid filled #6 "Output Attribution Report"
